 hashes the document as given and does not recompute `equivalence`. `merged_current` then raises `receipt binding mismatch` at `apps/crq-python/status_summary.py:98-101`. The bounded `done` entries do not reach the `proven_terminal` branch at lines 103-104. The case `captured-targets-are-sorted-and-bounded` does not exercise its intended projection.\n\nRecompute the digest after the override in the bounded loop. The other capture fields are unchanged, so `current_equivalence` accepts the capture.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n             bounded_capture = _capture_document(path_rows, target=target)\n+            bounded_capture[\"equivalence\"] = review_receipt.current_equivalence(bounded_capture)\n```\n\n</details>","id":"e918e6b67708f094d50618ec9f6ef3cc64858397c38796ae0265199748db9815","intervals":[[94,94]],"path":"apps/crq-python/fixtures/a1-status/emit.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Recompute bounded-target equivalence after the target override."}],"head":"d378b1a2f41b65af7c1d59990dc4db231bc569ae","head_tree":"43352e314f3c3a14ad68477aef868d1a2c87fd92","input_scope":[{"blob":"6f44176f1fe7ab507eca7679e4a967c761543357","intervals":[[1,94]],"path":"apps/crq-python/fixtures/a1-status/README.md"},{"blob":"11c21cca92a909921803eae23abdfb63a3c26627","intervals":[[1,2309]],"path":"apps/crq-python/fixtures/a1-status/emit.py"},{"blob":"400761829f43a58aa92c5add03fb6ac9549d5f1b","intervals":[[1,2406]],"path":"apps/crq-python/fixtures/a1-status/publish-sections.json"},{"blob":"e7a6cba0e96e32d86261b5d9df850959c7724df4","intervals":[[1,2278]],"path":"apps/crq-python/fixtures/a1-status/utilization.json"}],"job_id":"6cdd7d269f0b3dfc27ad03b0e41d8ddc1ff3702118e59bac2fa2e6e20c83f8f2:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"6f44176f1fe7ab507eca7679e4a967c761543357","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/fixtures/a1-status/README.